{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/Mega_Gif_-_reduced.gif?t=1748448622\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MEGACHESS</strong> is a tactical roguelite where you explore an underground dungeon with your army of chess pieces. Using their special effects and by merging them into <strong>MEGA-PIECES</strong>, battle hordes of enemies and bosses to reach the <i>Throne Room. </i>Can you face the <strong>MEGA-KING</strong><i> </i>and free your kind from their grasp?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/Endless_possibilities_2.gif?t=1748448622\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645080/extras/Key_Features0.png?t=1748448622\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Traverse the dungeon: </strong>Build districts of the dungeon as you explore it. Draft uncharted passages filled with fights, treasures, bosses and altars that permanently upgrade your army. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blast through fights without losing units</strong>: Tactical yet fast-paced, every ally or enemy has a single life point. Carefully choose and place your pieces, unleash devastating combos and eliminate all enemy pieces in one turn.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crush enemies with MEGA-PIECES</strong>: Merge similar pieces to form massive <strong>MEGA-PIECES</strong> that crush multiple enemies at once.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade the dungeon</strong>: Progress through 